Package: passcore
Version: 0.6.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Lovepreet Singh <work.moneyapenetwork@gmail.com>
Description: Secure offline password manager
 PassCore is a privacy-focused password manager with local encrypted vault storage.
 Uses AES-GCM encryption and Argon2id key derivation.
 No cloud synchronization or external services are required.
